- After create/update responses, also override form fields from the returned entity

**Fix (Backend - RecipeFileController.java):**
- `updateRecipeFile()`: Changed from replacing the entire entity (which could null out `createdAt`) to selectively updating only `name`, `version`, `description`, `yamlContent` on the existing entity

